This directory contains 3 files, including this one.

The file THMS-LMO.TST is the one searched by the command
	Concord test word
as given in the Preface.

The batch file called by typing
	Concord
translates "test" into "THMS-LMO.TST" and at the same time
adds the necessary characters to all the parameters, replacing
the word "word" with /f="word" and so on. It also adds other parameters that
make the program run properly from the batch file and eliminates
the need for the device driver ANSI.SYS.
